  "source_pdf": "downloads/iron-fans-pattern-parade-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "3da025224b207ad8315d3e1997b6e7cd69235ca96d5ce78436dc16e020c6b38f",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d0f4922d6eec345e41e47ff009816661e0d05b8d738e7cfcc1eb2d493590f9d1",
      "text": "铁扇公主的彩旗小麻烦",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "192637ba547ce48f7e1c93fe8365d15f75e3c654d5c8c477f6f9fd38017f6a1e",
      "text": "铁扇公主要办一场小游行。\n院子里拉着一根长长的绳子。\n她说：“我们来挂彩旗吧！”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "650b7d56d1d9b4f323c2be54c1b0312bdb4979fac07b53fac4042bac06d8caa9",
      "text": "哪吒提来一篮彩旗，\n有红色的，也有金色的。\n悟空把彩旗挂到绳子上。\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "12d6bdec2d9ed90f26259c90677df3e83f9d1af844f2d5fd73d59954f8f4f516",
      "text": "红、红、金。\n红、红、金。\n公主说：“这是一个规律，\n同样的一组一直重复。”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f4b9364d2167cfeb569fe33c648215e6ad7e10aaa6a4eaa80fe6f9bd2b0bf5a0",
      "text": "一阵小风吹来，\n彩旗轻轻地摆呀摆。\n悟空说：“游行马上要开始了，\n我得快一点！”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d6abf021b9579315042ea52d39eff572cdf4f26b7e53b14ecbb334758dc2ae13",
      "text": "悟空飞快地抓起彩旗：\n红……金……金！\n“挂好啦！”他大声说。\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f1ac856d56d1a4de94f05fdf294d4e2d1d99b28752462b5dc7ba9d7dd3d4f61f",
      "text": "哪吒往篮子里看了看：\n“还剩一面红旗。\n它是不是也该挂上去？”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ce5e2aea58b7605c3606d21d4ea68333a1ff7aa624a917cad58df1345f66bfc9",
      "text": "公主说：“我们拍拍手来检查。\n红旗拍手，金旗跺脚。”\n拍、拍、跺！\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "049ae26ba215562461414ce092c3cf10cfa7aa89ef6fa317c55da1c63ac593f6",
      "text": "大家沿着绳子拍：\n拍、拍、跺，拍、拍、跺，\n拍……跺、跺？\n悟空说：“怎么听起来怪怪的！”\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d9cdbf635529152f802d37d913d5934f967c5d7e518e48addc34e43d648dedae",
      "text": "他们一组一组地对照：\n红、红、金，一样。\n红、红、金，一样。\n红、金、金，不一样！\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5679877a581880e72b997e4b659ac4230017d1b29c42fd1059a9d1b48d04f5b5",
      "text": "哪吒说：“中间这面应该是红旗。\n因为每一组都一样，\n红旗后面才轮到金旗。”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "820ad8f13609441d3d76c8900206d9f7d2a99956d05be85b5fa207724a47b43a",
      "text": "悟空把中间那面金旗\n换成了红旗，\n再把金旗放回篮子里。\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bf183ec7df5288e8e9d3999850dde1decabb70274043387de6a29c8d855d733e",
      "text": "拍、拍、跺！\n拍、拍、跺！\n拍、拍、跺！\n“现在一直重复到底啦！”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d6c026226644b681ab6610ff9d296f878de53822ce9804787fc427a3eddeb761",
      "text": "游行开始啦！\n公主挥着扇子走在前面，\n哪吒拍着节拍。\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "59ca4bfa9ec782e1c636163e4f0710726aa3e725c11413a4cfbf83de2380ec8a",
      "text": "悟空在彩旗下面走：\n踏、踏、甩！\n踏、踏、甩！\n连尾巴也跟上了规律。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "29fc74d4d247f97366bc181196e2fa64f9897fffd2035601e3ee0bdd5bfe23fd",
      "text": "公主问：“下一个是什么？”\n踏、踏……\n大家一起喊：“甩！”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
